md=['# Existing-collection cutoff inventory','',f"Actual UTC cutoff: **{cutoff}**. Two consecutive complete path/stat enumerations were identical. No ledger scan, checkpoint or source write was performed.",'',f"The explicit inventory contains **{len(regular):,} regular files**, including **{len(documents):,} top-level monitor-eligible document copies**: "+', '.join(f"{k} {v:,}" for k,v in counts['monitor_documents_by_source'].items())+'.',f"There are **{len(new):,} newly seen eligible files** requiring authoritative group mapping, **{len(changed):,} mapped files with changed/reappeared stat signatures**, **{len(missing):,} formerly present ledger files absent**, and **{len(nested):,} nested document candidates** outside the current monitor’s top-level scope.",'',f"The bound ledger was last scanned at {ledger['last_scan_at']}. It contains **{len(groups):,} provisional scopes** and **{len(pending):,} pending scopes**, historically reported as **{queue['counts']['waiting_review_scopes']:,} waiting + {queue['counts']['active_review_claims']} active**. These are the last-known grouping counts, not a new unique-paper count or a fresh pending-scope total after new files are mapped.",'','The membership list is the immutable boundary for the existing-collection target. The capture time is real and was not retrodated. Repeated path/stat agreement establishes a stable observation window, not atomic snapshot semantics or byte-level identity. Historical source hashes are not represented as freshly verified hashes.','','Recommended queue integration: resolve cutoff file membership to current canonical groups, retain the active claim and normal priority/generation gates, and place genuinely new post-cutoff papers in a separate arrival queue. Changed files or newly matched SI for an included paper remain evidence updates to that included paper and must reopen dependent review. Record duplicate/alias/mapping corrections separately instead of silently changing the frozen file denominator.','','See `queue-filter-recommendation.json` for exact proposed rules. No filter is activated by this report. Exact file paths, stat signatures and dispositions are in `file-inventory.json`; the immutable ledger and group mapping are retained beside it. No full source text or source PDF was copied.','']
